A quote after a bare delimiter follows what that delimiter does

```
*"x"

a *"x" b

a **"x" b
.
<p>*”x”</p>
<p>a *”x” b</p>
<p>a **”x” b</p>
```

```
a *"x"* b

a ~*"x"* b
.
<p>a <strong>“x”</strong> b</p>
<p>a ~<strong>“x”</strong> b</p>
```

```
a.*"x"* b

a,_"x"_ b
.
<p>a.<strong>“x”</strong> b</p>
<p>a,<u>“x”</u> b</p>
```

```
x{*"y"*}
.
<p>x<strong>“y”</strong></p>
```

```
{*a *"x"*}
.
<p><strong>a *”x”</strong></p>
```

```
*"'x'
.
<p>*”’x’</p>
```

```
a*"x"* b

/"x"

="x"
.
<p>a*”x”* b</p>
<p>/“x”</p>
<p>=“x”</p>
```
